{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "english", "appid": 553850, "month": "2026-07", "window": 4, "start_date": 1784851200, "end_date": 1785542399, "month_true_total": 2966, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:18:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "231778680", "author": {"steamid": "76561199813640406", "personaname": "NeaterYeeter207", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199813640406/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 9860, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1556, "playtime_at_review": 6017, "last_played": 1788055359, "avatar": "50e74d87b235b65992a6be1eae109c680714c66b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Goated game. Super Goated, in fact. It even encourages you to prioritize playing it, without it feeling forced - something which is very rare nowadays. It has an awesome premise, provides an excellent experience whether played with friends or without them, all while having a sense of humor which can go from brutally slapstick to freakishly self-aware in an instant. And none of this feels \"forced\" about it at all.  That's why I think that this is a game which really, authentically provides you with true freedom.", "timestamp_created": 1785541716, "timestamp_updated": 1785541716, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "hardware": {"system_ram": "15499", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 250 w/ Radeon 780M", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon(TM) 780M Graphics", "vram_size": 512}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231778568", "author": {"steamid": "76561199430538487", "personaname": "Battycaribou712", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199430538487/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 12911, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2239, "playtime_at_review": 7557, "last_played": 1787972429, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "english", "review": "Get some friends, buy a warbond, and spread democracy", "timestamp_created": 1785541560, "timestamp_updated": 1785541560, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231777092", "author": {"steamid": "76561199862182017", "personaname": "lucyoakheart", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199862182017/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 13314, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 5172, "playtime_at_review": 2034, "last_played": 1788023026, "avatar": "65bb793e01bee9692dbd7cdfa484c5383a792ffa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Im still pretty new to the game, but for now Helldivers 2 is blowing me away. Insanely fun gameplay, specially when youve got a squad that is all in sync, covering for each other, alternating cooldowns, gathering for supplies, trying not to friendly fire each other, etc\n\nYou dont get this every match if you play with randoms like me, but when you do its insane. I recommend you get some of ur friends to play it with you if you wanna dive into it, but even as a solo you can still have a lot of fun", "timestamp_created": 1785539828, "timestamp_updated": 1785539828, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231776608", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048833884", "personaname": "Calagridsil", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Calagridsil/", "num_games_owned": 28, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 11181, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2492, "playtime_at_review": 5705, "last_played": 1788059512, "avatar": "2b97be035dc905046182054393a1fb7b779adee0"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is genuinely one of the greatest games ever made.  I will admit that it has its faults (especially in the balancing department), but I can attest that even at its lowest this game is still leagues better than others of its type.  I cannot recommend this game enough, try it out and I can guarantee that you’ll see the reason why it has so many players.", "timestamp_created": 1785539256, "timestamp_updated": 1785539256, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231776299", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023041520", "personaname": "Spookypin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198023041520/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 12652, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 7, "playtime_at_review": 10923, "last_played": 1787958106, "avatar": "8707319fd87ef78f9c3166d44d5a928d72230415"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolute Democracy", "timestamp_created": 1785538939, "timestamp_updated": 1785538939, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}